{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2022-12-16 08:00:00', 'title': 'LEIDOS TAPS FORMER TSA ACTING ADMINISTRATOR AS STRATEGIC ACCOUNT EXECUTIVE', 'text': "RESTON, VA. , DEC. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEIDOS (NYSE:LDOS),\xa0A FORTUNE®\xa0500 SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY LEADER, TODAY ANNOUNCED DARBY LAJOYE AS THE COMPANY'S VICE PRESIDENT AND STRATEGIC ACCOUNT EXECUTIVE FOR THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF HOMELAND SECURITY (DHS)."}